%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b1ce7e6b2aaa1fb408b54e6f771d8d4f, type: 3}
  m_Name: New CSV Reader
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  TextCsv: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 02bbaa12a92db3c4a974ae105d095e25, type: 3}
  AllTexts:
    SmallTexts:
    - ID: dialogue ID
      Text: Text
      animation: Emotion
    - ID: char1_day1_part1
      Text: Greetings, Mortal. My servants tell me I can get my attire cleaned in
        this esteemed... establishment?
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part1_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Correct, I clean clothes.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part1_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Yes, silly! Didn't you see the huge neon sign that says "Clean
        for the Mean"?
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part1_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Nice, looks like word of my "esteemed establishment" got around.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part2
      Text: Indeed. Would you be able to return this shirt to its original, pristine
        condition?
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day1_part3
      Text: Tell me, are you experienced in cleaning blood stains?
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day1_part3_responce1
      Text: (Dry) I'm in business with evil. Getting rid of blood is my bread and
        butter.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part3_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Oh, that's a big one! The other guy didn't live to tell the
        tale, I imagine. Good on you!
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part3_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Blood? That looks more like wine to me, Pookie.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part4_lowPoints
      Text: It's a big stain and I can assure you it's blood. Blood indeed.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part5_lowPoints
      Text: And not wine at all...
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day1_part6_lowPoints
      Text: I should know, I'm a Vampire Elder. Baronex Duskmantle of Midnight's
        Keep to be exact.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day1_part6_lowPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) It smells like wine, it looks like wine. I will treat it like wine.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part6_lowPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) But it smells like... Ooh, got it. Of course dear Baronex, I
        will totally get rid of this BLOOD stain for you!
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part6_lowPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Whatever the stain, I'll make sure to get that shirt back on
        you asap.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part7_lowPoints
      Text: I shall return to collect the garment tomorrow. I hope your services
        will please my sophisticated taste.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day1_part4_highPoints
      Text: It's a big stain and I can assure you it's blood. Blood indeed.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part5_highPoints
      Text: My victim lost a lot of it when I fed on them last night. I'm a Vampire
        Elder, you see.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day1_part6_highPoints
      Text: "Baronex Duskmantle of Midnight's Keep to be exact. Enchant\xE9..."
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day1_part7_highPoints
      Text: Pray do tell, have you ever worked for a Vampire before? Most common
        folk find us most... frightening.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day1_part7_highPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Most my clientele is dangerous. I am confident my excellent services
        will keep me in business. And alive.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part7_highPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) A real Vampire Elder? I'm positively thrilled! But don't worry.
        I'm not scared. Most my clients are kinda dangerous.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part7_highPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) I got many dangerous customers but none look as sharp as you.
        The bloodlust suits you well.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part8_highPoints
      Text: You are a gutsy one! Living here amongst such murderous creatures can't
        be easy.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day1_part9_highPoints
      Text: Sometimes even a Vampire can feel discouraged around such marvelous villainy.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part10_highPoints
      Text: Especially if this theoretical Vampire was inept at hunting prey...
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day1_part11_highPoints
      Text: Which is not me, of course! I'm an exceptional hunterex! Confirmed by
        the blood stains on my shirt which are NOT wine at all.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day1_part12_highPoints
      Text: I'm looking forward to collect my garment tomorrow. And to see you again,
        dear Mortal.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day1_part1
      Text: Hey, you the one doin' laundry, right?
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part2
      Text: I got some oil on this work-overall. Can you get it out?
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day1_part2_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Certainly. Looks like motor oil. Shouldn't be a problem.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part2_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Sticky stuff, but I can get it out. I don't want a cutie like
        you running around with motor oil stains.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part2_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Motor oil, synthetic blend. Stubborn, but I'll get it out.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part3
      Text: Yeah, I needed to fix somethin' on my Mistress's orbital laser.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day1_part4
      Text: Got quite dirty in the process.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day1_part5
      Text: 'You know how Super Villains are: The bigger the laser, the better.'
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part5_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Super Villains. Most of them are just rich brats, not understanding
        the intricacies of crime.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part5_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Gotta love a big laser! And a dirty henchwoman.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part5_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Well, you need a big laser to scare the shit out of these plebs.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part6_lowPoints
      Text: 'Yeah, whatever... I need this overall cleaned. '
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part7_lowPoints
      Text: If you don't suck, I'll come back. I'm sure my Mistress will have me
        crawl inside some machinery again soon.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day1_part8_lowPoints
      Text: She is quite...
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day1_part8_lowPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) ...
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part8_lowPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Cool?
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part8_lowPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Incompetent? Annoying?
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part9_lowPoints
      Text: Demanding.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day1_part10_lowPoints
      Text: Anyway, I'm out. Do your job well and I'll return with more shit to clean.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part6_highPoints
      Text: You sound like you know what you're talking about. I respect that.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day1_part7_highPoints
      Text: These higher-ups act like they are the shit but they don't know that
        people like us make the world go round.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day1_part8_highPoints
      Text: I'll be a good customer for you, ya know. My Mistress has me climb in
        all sort of shit.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part9_highPoints
      Text: So I have a lot of laundry that needs taking care of.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day1_part9_highPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) I always take care of my customers.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part9_highPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) I'd love to take care of you- ehm... Of your clothing.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part9_highPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Just don't bring in anything too nasty. I don't do contagious
        stuff.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part10_highPoints
      Text: Right. Just get that oil stain out and I'll be happy as a clam.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day1_part11_highPoints
      Text: And trust me, you don't want to see me unhappy.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part1
      Text: Gree...tings. Mo- mo... ortal...
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day2_part1_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Hello.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part1_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Are you okay? Do you need a glass of water? Or uhm, a goblet
        of blood?
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part1_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Damn, what got you lookin' all sweaty?
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part2
      Text: I ju... I just went for a nice evening... stroll.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part3
      Text: A stroll that included vigorous running and jumping. And a very small
        tumble on my part.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day2_part3
      Text: If you could take care of my hunting cloak, I would be most obliged.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day2_part3_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Maybe you shouldn't hunt. Successful vampires let their prey come
        to them.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part3_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Oh gosh... Maybe you should let people come to you in the future
        instead of running after them.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part3_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Why do you need to go hunting anyway? Throw a party or something.
        I'm sure people would come in flocks.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part4_lowPoints
      Text: Thank you for your... input. But let's focus on the task at hand. My
        hunting cloak!
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part5_lowPoints
      Text: There are some grass stains on it and sweat.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day2_part6_lowPoints
      Text: But it's not my sweat! That would be quite unbecoming of a Vampire Elder
        of my standing.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day2_part6_lowPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) The sweat of your victim, perhaps?
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part6_lowPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Awww, but it's not embarrassing to be a little sweaty. It happens
        to all of us.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part6_lowPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Yeah, sure. That's also why your forehead is NOT covered in sweat.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part7_lowPoints
      Text: Just clean it please. That's what I'm paying you for, isn't it.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part4_highPoints
      Text: My sweet Mortal, that is indeed a splendid suggestion!
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day2_part5_highPoints
      Text: "I shall try it. A dinner party perhaps, or a soir\xE9e, or even... a
        cheeky get-together."
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day2_part6_highPoints
      Text: I'd invite YOU of course but alas, you need to clean my cloak. I apologize,
        dear One.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day2_part7_highPoints
      Text: I think there is a grass stain from my tumble and some sweat.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part8_highPoints
      Text: Please don't tell anyone that I can actually sweat. That would break
        my dark, unbeating heart.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day2_part8_highPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) I have no interest in gossiping.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part8_highPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Aww, but why not? I think it would make you more approachable!
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part8_highPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Yeah, I won't tell anyone. Probably...
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part9_highPoints
      Text: I trust you won't tell anyone for you haven't given me any reason to
        doubt you.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day2_part10_highPoints
      Text: I can't wait to see you again, my Dear.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day2_part1
      Text: Ugh...
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day2_part1_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Hello.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part1_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Oh, you look kinda sad. What's wrong?
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part1_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) You look like shit. What happened?
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part2
      Text: Being a henchwoman is just the fucking worst. I can deal with the dirt,
        the insults, the violence, even the irregular working hours.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part3
      Text: But the evil schemes this woman comes up with... They're just dumb!
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day2_part3_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Sounds like you should get rid of her. Or replace her.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part3_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Oh, that's horrible. I'm sorry to hear... You should switch
        roles with her. That'll teach her.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part3_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Usually henchwomen don't complain so much. Maybe you should become
        a villain instead.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part4_lowPoints
      Text: Me replacing her? Tss, that's not how it works, soap-nerd.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day2_part5_lowPoints
      Text: Anyway, my Mistress' last ingenious plan was to punish the pizza-guy
        next to our secret lair.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day2_part6_lowPoints
      Text: He discontinued her favorite pizza, so she kidnapped his baby.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part7_lowPoints
      Text: 'Now I have to watch that brat until the guy surrenders or dies or whatever.
        Fucking GREAT idea, if you ask me. '
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day2_part7_lowPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) I didn't ask. But that explains the stains.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part7_lowPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Ah baby?! Omg that's sooo cute!
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part7_lowPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) So you have to take care of the baby now? Gross...
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part8_lowPoints
      Text: It's fucking annyoing... I got drool and babyfood stains all over my
        work-clothes.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day2_part9_lowPoints
      Text: But that's your problem now. Take care of it for me, okay sweetcheeks?
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day2_part4_highPoints
      Text: You think I should become a Super Villain? That's insane... But maybe
        you're on to something.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day2_part5_highPoints
      Text: I sure as fuck would be better at making evil plans. You know what she
        did?
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day2_part6_highPoints
      Text: She was angry at the pizza-guy next door because he discontinued her
        favorite pizza.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part7_highPoints
      Text: She could've blown up the shop, poisoned the marinara sauce, cut off
        his fingers, anything...
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day2_part8_highPoints
      Text: But she decided to kidnap his baby. And now I have to take care of it.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part9_highPoints
      Text: I mean, look at my clothes! They're full of baby food and drool!!!
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day2_part9_highPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) I'll just clean the stains for you, I don't need a backstory.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part9_highPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) That's horrible! Your evil plans are a million times more wicked
        than hers.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part9_highPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Well, that's a stupid fucking idea. But cutting off his fingers?
        Come on...
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part10_highPoints
      Text: Anyway, what's done is done. And I need you to get these stains out.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day2_part11_highPoints
      Text: I'm glad I can count on you. You really are good at your job, soap-nerd.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day2_part12_highPoints
      Text: I got a thing for nerds, ya know. I like how they get nervous and shit.
        It's cute.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day3_part1
      Text: You are a proper genius, sweet Mortal. I did what you recommended.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day3_part2
      Text: I hosted a lavishly decadent tupperware party. They practically BEGGED
        me to grant them entrance.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part3
      Text: Like sheep to the slaughter. It was positively divine!
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day3_part4
      Text: And I picked the plumpest one to join me for the after party... The blood
        on my silken night-blouse is that was left of her.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day3_part4_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Sounds like a successful night.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part4_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Oh, it sounds wonderful! I'm so sad I missed it. Especially
        the after party.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part4_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Your silken night-blouse? A tupperware party??? Come on dude,
        where's the carnage?
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part5
      Text: It was a titillating night... I haven't indulged in the pleasures of
        flesh and blood in a long time.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part6
      Text: You'll discover stains of my favorite massage oils on there too. We were
        utterly naughty before, well... I killed her.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day3_part6_responce1
      Text: (Dry) I really, REALLY do not wish to hear more about your titillating
        night.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part6_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Sounds like you had a lovely night. Her too, up until the end
        at least.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part6_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Yeah, that's more like it! Tell me more about the blood. Was
        it gushing? Splattering?
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part7_lowPoints
      Text: I don't want to bore you with any more details. Just know, the night
        was a big success, thanks to you.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part8_lowPoints
      Text: Maybe I'll invite you to one of my parties one day.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day3_part8_lowPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) I will decline.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part8_lowPoints_responce2
      Text: '(Bubbly) That would be amazing. I love parties, tupperware, and sexy
        vampires! '
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part8_lowPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) I might show up, as long as it isn't a fucking tupperware party.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part9_lowPoints
      Text: We'll see what the future brings... Or at least I will. You humans have
        preposterously short life-spans, right?
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day3_part10_lowPoints
      Text: Especially if there are ravenous vampires lurking around. Vampires that
        just got reminded of the sweet taste of blood.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day3_part7_highPoints
      Text: I don't want to bore you with any more details. Just know, the night
        was a big success. Thanks to you, my Dear.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day3_part8_highPoints
      Text: There was a one thing though that left a bad taste in my mouth after
        all.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day3_part9_highPoints
      Text: I was missing you, my Dear. Your wit, your dauntlessness, your bewitching
        eyes...
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part10_highPoints
      Text: Thoughts of you follow me, wherever I go. Like the scent of detergent,
        softly lingering in the ether.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day3_part10_highPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) And just like ink on a white shirt, you will never get rid of me.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part10_highPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Did you just compare me to... laundry detergent? That's not
        how you romance a hottie like me.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part10_highPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) You lost me with the detergent thing, sorry. Don't you wanna
        talk about blood again?
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day3_part11_highPoints
      Text: That is the dauntlessness I was talking about. Who would dare to speak
        to a Vampire Elder that way?
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day3_part12_highPoints
      Text: I take great delight in your company and in being your customer. I am
        certain that you will get rid of these oil and blood stains.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day3_part13_highPoints
      Text: But I'm also plagued by dark thoughts, my Dear.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day3_part14_highPoints
      Text: To know that you, a human, will have to perish one day... Accepting that
        feels almost insurmountable.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day3_part15_highPoints
      Text: But regardless, I will leave you to your work. I'm sure I will be greatly
        satisfied as always, dear One.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day3_part1
      Text: Yo, I did it! I got rid of that incompetent roach of a Super Villain.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day3_part2
      Text: I didn't kill her or anything. I just locked her in one of her torture-labyrinths.
        Which I built FIY.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day3_part3
      Text: She'll never find her way out of it, ha! And I'm the new Villain in town.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day3_part4
      Text: I got a Super Villain overall now too. I don't fuck with spandex.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day3_part4_responce1
      Text: (Dry) A bit uninspired but overalls are easier to clean anyway.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part4_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) An overall? Really? Isn't that a bit boring? There are such
        cool spandex suits out there...
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part4_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) So what do you fuck with?
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part5
      Text: Well, I... Wanted to talk about the stains on my overall, actually. Look,
        there's a bunch of sweat and blood on it.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part6
      Text: I like the look of it but this thing reaks. I need it cleaned before
        I execute my next evil plan. Which...
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day3_part6_responce1
      Text: (Dry) I do not wish to hear your evil plan. I will not be an accessory
        to a crime.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part6_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Oh, yes! Tell me your evil plan. I NEED to know!!!
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part6_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Oh sick, are you seriously gonna tell me your evil plan? Isn't
        that usually a secret or something?
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part7_lowPoints
      Text: You know what, nevermind. I'm not gonna tell you my plan.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part8_lowPoints
      Text: Which I definitely have. And that is super elaborate and like super dark
        and twisted...
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day3_part8_lowPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Okay.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part8_lowPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Aw man... You sure? I bet it IS really cool and elaborate and
        twisted.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part8_lowPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) That's so lame, dude. Why tease it then?
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part9_lowPoints
      Text: Maybe it was my PLAN to have you guess. Ya know, another scheme from
        the Blue Collared Menace.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day3_part10_lowPoints
      Text: Which is my Super Villain name btw. Blue... Collared... Menace...
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day3_part11_lowPoints
      Text: So get these stains out or my next plan might involve a certain laundry
        shop.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part7_highPoints
      Text: Actually, I don't really have an evil plan yet.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part8_highPoints
      Text: Turns out, I'm a great henchwoman but a fucking horrible schemer.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day3_part9_highPoints
      Text: My old Mistress was terrible at it too, don't get me wrong. But it's
        actually a lot harder than I thought.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part10_highPoints
      Text: That's also the reason I came to you. I feel like you're smart.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day3_part11_highPoints
      Text: And being a business-person or whatever is not easy. Not in this shit
        economy.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part12_highPoints
      Text: Sooo, what I'm saying is... Do you maybe wanna work together sometime?
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day3_part13_highPoints
      Text: I know you got your laundry thing going and I still need you to get rid
        of these blood and sweat stains.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part14_highPoints
      Text: But maybe you have time for a little side hustle?
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day3_part14_highPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Interesting proposition. Maybe I do have time for a side hustle
        in crime.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part14_highPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Working together with you sounds fun! But I'm more of a lover
        than a fighter, I think.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part14_highPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) So I'm supposed to be your henchling? Fuck no...
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part15_highPoints
      Text: In any case, you helped me out last time. Saying I should replace my
        Ex-Mistress and all.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day3_part16_highPoints
      Text: For a nerd, you're kinda cool. And you smell like soap. I like that.
      animation: happy
  char1: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbf3a01f656b1a4429b4bfd7c1be7706, type: 2}
  char2: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b7f76945b20d817448832a1f5532fbd3, type: 2}
